# Bug 8: funct 14 is mvin3 (load pipeline 2). The old ILA's funct input is 3 bits wide,
# so it can't express funct 14 and ila_sim skips the instruction.
# Where: src/gemmini.cc:17, funct = NewBvInput("funct", 3); should be 7 bits (funct7).
#   Missing: an mvin3 instruction (include/gemmini.h:30-37 has no funct 14).
# Spec: RTL GemminiISA.scala:24, LOAD3_CMD = 14; LoadController.scala:61-62 maps it to load
#   state 2. funct is the 7-bit RoCC funct7: GemminiISA.scala:7-38 uses values up to 25, and
#   line 60 has COUNTER_OP = 126.U(7.W).
# Expected: scratchpad row 0 col 0 = 9.
# Old ILA: 0 ("ILA ran: nothing").
config funct=0 rs1=0x3f80000000100011 rs2=0x0000000000000010
.mem 0x10000 09
mvin3  funct=14 rs1=0x0000000000010000 rs2=0x0001000100000000
